<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>ORE - SGC China - (150,000 tonnes Ubu/Ijmuiden Dec/Jan $6.00/$6.25 fio six days shinc Hoogovens.</p>
